docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:7:## Operation 2: Benchmark and the cost decision
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:13:- Result: exit 0, 4 min 33 s on the laptop (1 worker); `timings.json`, `cost_table.json`, `benchmark_plan.json` written. No spend.
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:20:  - Launcher `results/pods/bench_pod.sh` (a copy of `explore_pod.sh`): 16-vCPU pods only (`create16.py`), refuses a price above 0.56 USD per hour, the prep check requires `git rev-parse HEAD` = 627a2de on the pod, and `--usd-per-pod-hour` is the pod's measured `costPerHr`.
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:25:- Promotion: `promote_v2.py --kind benchmark --from results/v2/benchmark --markets headline,dev0 --code-commit 627a2de…` → `experiments/v2/benchmark/timings.json` (sha256 0a9ec988…ce2e7), `cost_table.json` (07e0941a…8ec14).
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:30:- Decision: branch `two20k` (headline and dev0; replacement fixture design of 9.5), cuts 3, development 11.17 USD (2.54 spent), evaluation 38.08 USD (H4 reserve 1 USD included), total 49.25 USD, **approval required** (total above 40 USD), no stop.
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:31:- Cuts 3 (design 8.2, in order): (1) whole-system cells on fresh markets, (2) H4 on fresh markets (Q3's independently authored part is headline only), (3) D2 matched extras on fresh markets.
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:101:- Development spent 11.42 USD of 12; no open reservations. Failed attempts cost about 0.6 USD in total (lessons: AppleDouble members, memory at full size, shallow history, launcher edited while running).
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:123:- **(b) Coverage before the H4 decision.** The frozen decision estimates 49.15505 USD from the pre-coverage ledger; actual development spend plus the estimated evaluation cost is 49.50558 USD (11.42 + 38.08558). Cut 2 would cost 40.37494 USD for the evaluation, so cut 3 remains the first admissible cut. Both decision records are kept; the protocol's cost fields are the frozen decision's.
docs/revision/operations-ledger.md:201:- Paper results review: round 1 Astra reject (7 corrections, fixed in 52254cf), Sol run lost to a session restart; round 2 Sol accept-with-caveat (audit-cost wording, applied), Astra accept. Consensus.
